{"name":"Lustful Wishes","hex":"#cc4499","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"lustful","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Full of lust; driven by lust."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/lustful"},{"term":"wishes","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of wish"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["third-person singular simple present indicative of wish"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wishes"}],"entries":[{"title":"Lust","blocks":[{"text":"Lust is an intense desire for something. Lust can take any form such as the lust for sexual activity, money, or power; but it can also take such mundane forms as the lust for food or the lust for redolence. Lust is similar to, but distinguished from, passion, in that properly ordered passion propels individuals to achieve benevolent goals whilst lust does not."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Jheronimus_Bosch_Table_of_the_Mortal_Sins_%28Luxuria%29.jpg/330px-Jheronimus_Bosch_Table_of_the_Mortal_Sins_%28Luxuria%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lust","wikidata":"Q6498477"},{"title":"Wish","blocks":[{"text":"A wish is a hope or desire for something. In fiction, wishes can be used as plot devices. In folklore, opportunities for \"making a wish\" or for wishes to \"come true\" or \"be granted\" are themes that are sometimes used."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/I_samma_%C3%B6gonblick_var_hon_f%C3%B6rvandlad_till_en_undersk%C3%B6n_liten_%C3%A4lva.jpg/330px-I_samma_%C3%B6gonblick_var_hon_f%C3%B6rvandlad_till_en_undersk%C3%B6n_liten_%C3%A4lva.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wish","wikidata":"Q241625"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Daemon.jpg/500px-Daemon.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&